ino", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place to play games and bet ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love going to the casino.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "two-way (radio) ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a radio that can send and receive messages over the air waves", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have your two-way with you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tips", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extra money someone gets as a reward for good service", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to spend my tips shopping!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Ask 3 friends if they have any lucky items.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If they do, ask them to tell you about their lucky object. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Fill out the chart below with the information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share their answers with another group.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Lucky Object \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What They Use it For\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\